  m_Text: "\nTo bring an achievement to life, \x03you must have a strong internet
    connection. First, tap the Saved icon in the bottom menu bar. \x03Select your
    event. Then, tap the yellow Blingar icon to activate your camera. Point your
    camera at your medal (or other solid surface) and hold it steady. Your augmented
    reality experience should begin within a few seconds. Any delay will be due to
    your internet signal strength.\r\n"
